e-benefits-block .benefit-item {\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .nerve-benefits-block .benefit-icon {\n      width: 33px;\n      height: 33px;\n    }\n    .nerve-benefits-block .benefit-icon svg {\n      width: 16.5px;\n      height: 16.5px;\n    }\n    .nerve-benefits-block .benefit-text {\n      font-size: 11.5px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
